MODULE: EvaluationRejectsUnbounded
TARGET: TruthfulEvaluation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a null ceiling is treated as a zero ceiling

--- FIND
Breach(d) == quotas[d] # Unbounded /\ usage[d] > Ceiling(d)
--- REPLACE
Breach(d) == IF quotas[d] = Unbounded THEN usage[d] > 0 ELSE usage[d] > Ceiling(d)
--- END
